---
export interface Props {
  context?: "article-end" | "sidebar" | "hero";
}

const { context = "article-end" } = Astro.props;

const isSidebar = context === "sidebar";
---

<aside
  class={`cta-block cta-block--${context}`}
  style={`
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a5c8f 0%, #1a7ab8 100%);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: ${isSidebar ? "1.25rem" : "2rem"};
    margin: ${isSidebar ? "0" : "3rem 0"};
    text-align: center;
  `}
>
  <p style="font-size:0.85rem; opacity:0.85; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
    水産業界の転職・就職
  </p>
  <p
    style={`font-size:${isSidebar ? "1.1rem" : "1.4rem"}; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:0.75rem; line-height:1.4;`}
  >
    無料キャリア相談<br />受付中
  </p>
  <p style="font-size:0.875rem; opacity:0.9; margin-bottom:1.25rem; line-height:1.6;">
    水産加工・養殖・漁師・水産営業への転職を<br />
    専門コンサルタントが無料でサポート。
  </p>
  <a
    href="/soudan"
    style="
      display:inline-block;
      background:#e8a020;
      color:#fff;
      font-weight:700;
      padding:0.75rem 2rem;
      border-radius:6px;
      text-decoration:none;
      font-size:1rem;
      transition:background 0.2s;
    "
    onmouseover="this.style.background='#d08f10'"
    onmouseout="this.style.background='#e8a020'"
  >
    今すぐ無料相談する →
  </a>
  <p style="font-size:0.75rem; opacity:0.7; margin-top:0.75rem;">
    完全無料・秘密厳守・いつでも退会可
  </p>
</aside>
